From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:46:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] board: qualcomm: add Fairphone 2

U-Boot is chainloaded by the stock LK or lk2nd from the boot partition and takes over the display, eMMC, keys and USB they leave set up. Like lk2nd, it gives the OS device tree the compatible of the panel fitted, which the generic Fairphone 2 panel node lacks.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
